04468,36.05230794]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"鶴巻運動公園","category":"nature","address":"比企郡嵐山町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"11342","municipality_pref":"埼玉県","municipality_name":"嵐山町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.32786554,36.05043739]}}],"display_comment_original":"嵐山町周辺には、近世村の記憶として菅谷村、志賀村、大蔵村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、菅谷館跡・須賀谷城跡、杉山城跡、越畑城跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、菅谷村、志賀村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["源義仲","畠山重忠","源義賢"],"notable_people":["源義仲","畠山重忠","源義賢","かぜ耕士"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["菅谷館（城）跡","杉山城","大蔵館跡","鎌形八幡宮","鬼鎮神社","遠山寺","広正寺","月輪古墳群"],"specialties":["嵐山辛モツ焼そば"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B5%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1139202","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3128268","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11564279","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11263844","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%BA%90%E7%BE%A9%E4%BB%B2&keyword=%E5%B5%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"嵐山町","wikipedia_revision_id":"108496208","wikidata_qid":"Q1358642","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B5%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%BA%90%E7%BE%A9%E4%BB%B2&keyword=%E5%B5%90%E5%B1%B1%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}